        "@value": "The ACTRA Toronto Minors Committee is holding their next meeting on Friday April 10 2026 from 4pm – 6pm on Zoom. We are excited to discuss what 2026 holds for the Committee, the results of the survey and next steps. Don’t forget follow us on Instagram @actratorontominors The ACTRA Toronto Minors Committee is member-driven open [&hellip;]"
      },
