        "@value": "The Video Game Working Group is excited to invite members to an online workshop with voice director Lindsey Gardner on April 23rd from 1-2:30 pm. Whether you’re curious about breaking into video game performance, looking to sharpen your skills, or just want to learn more about the craft, this will be a fun and practical session. [&hellip;]"
