      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ATTENTION NEW ACTRA TORONTO MEMBERS Join your ACTRA Toronto Councillors, staff and new sibling members for a special event designed just for you! You&#8217;ll have the opportunity to ask questions, engage, and discover where you fit within your union in a relaxed, welcoming environment.  Take this chance to learn more about ACTRA Toronto and get [&hellip;]"
